src/genro_toolchain/dockerize/ is a standalone reimplementation of the
`gnr app dockerize` command from GenroPy. The generated Dockerfile layout,
gunicorn and supervisord configuration templates, image labels and
docker-compose output are derived from:

Frozen upstream revision: 5dd6d6bf7
https://github.com/genropy/genropy
  gnrpy/gnr/app/cli/gnrdockerize.py
  gnrpy/gnr/dev/builder.py
  gnrpy/gnr/app/pathresolver.py
  gnrpy/gnr/utils/dockercompose.py

